Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.58,0:01:59.54,Title,,0,0,0,,{=2}{\fad(480,500)\bord2\blur3\shad0\\c&H000000&\4c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1817.4,909.4)}Reunion, Coco, Lick
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We put those monsters in their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well spotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attaboy, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She complimented me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'm bound to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm lucky, I'll get strong\Nenough to protect Miss Kyouka!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what kind of reward\Nis this supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't sustained\Nany injuries, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's appropriate for Nei, but doing this\Ntype of thing with me is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.89,0:03:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's completely untrue! It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand your appetites.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.31,0:03:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, our Yuki's making more progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He follows my orders to a T,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.73,0:03:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seeking out the most efficient method\Non his own before taking action.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fantastic, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're so adorable in\Nyour blushing little sleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Tenka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander Izumo, don't you think you\Nshould be heading back to your dorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you always been this talented?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:04:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't say I'm talented exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my big sister taught me a\Nlot when I was a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big sister? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said your big sister\Nwas pretty cool, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.63,0:04:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must really admire her. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what she was like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like that you're\Nalways ignoring me, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cause you're always\Nsaying mean things to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid, play nice\Nwith my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off my brother! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki! Are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned a move or two from\Nplaying pro wrestler with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not some little wimp, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's my precious little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.91,0:05:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get an A+.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for a celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go get a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay.
