Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.05,0:05:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just the way she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sounds like a good sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was training you and\Nyou didn't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Younger siblings sure do\Nhave it rough sometimes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we figured out\Nwhat makes Yuki tick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, take the rest of\Nthe evening off. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a bath and then a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go home, Tenka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.15,0:05:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.87,0:05:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this talk of big sisters\Nis making Ney feel jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're the only ones\Nwithout siblings, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the youngest in my family,\Nbut everyone liked to spoil me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I detect someone in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four kilometers south! Himari!\NShushu! On the devil! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DDF in the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, we got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that!

